# I18N

- Every user-facing string comes from `i18n/<lang>.json` via `{{t('feature.key')}}`; keys are `feature.element.state`.
- Launch languages: {{en, te, hi}}; translations reviewed by a native speaker; mark language changes in content (`lang`).
- Plurals and numbers/dates via `Intl`; no string concatenation for sentences.

## Never
- Hard-coded copy
- machine-only translation for critical text
- images containing text
